			(property "Description" "Carrier-side CON3 for the ALINX AC7200 SOM: Panasonic AXK680337YG P5K 80-pin 0.5mm header (3.0mm mated, bosses), mating the module's AXK580137YG socket CON3. Pin names are the AC7200 signals on module CON3 (from unit C of 'AC7200 Interface', same pin positions); pin numbers 1-80 are the header's, socket pin n mates header pin n."
